```
Primary button: caramel gradient from #C98B58 to #A9643A with cream text, or deep brown for contrast. Use deep brown gradient? "Brown caramel" primary. I'll use linear-gradient(135deg,#C98B58,#A9643A) with cream text. Hover shadow.

Evening tokens:
```
html[data-theme=evening]{
 --cream:#241611; --cream-2:#2E1D16; --beige:#38241B; --beige-deep:#42291E;
 --pink:#4A2A31; --pink-soft:#3A232A; --pink-strong:#E8A2B2;
 --sky:#28414C; --sky-soft:#2B3A40;
 --caramel:#D9A066; --caramel-deep:#F0BE8B; --caramel-soft:#7A5334;
 --gold:#F0C97A; --ink:#FFF2E2; --muted:#CDB39C; --line:rgba(240,201,122,.16);
 --card:#332017; --card-solid:#38241A;
