Careful hover transform for arrow also flips. Use `[dir=rtl] .btn:hover .icon-arrow{transform:scaleX(-1) translateX(-4px)}` or define animation via translate. Simpler: `[dir=rtl] .icon-arrow{transform:scaleX(-1)}` and `.btn:hover svg{transform:translateX(4px)}` would override. Use CSS var: `.btn .icon-arrow{transition}` etc. Add `[dir=rtl] .btn:hover svg{transform:scaleX(-1) translateX(-4px)}`. Fine.

